-- What the informal proofs of sag/zmt-rees4 open, declaration by
-- declaration (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6), for 47 central declarations.
-- Each list was compared with the file comment of its declaration.
-- Besides the notions each proof is about (Ev/EvZ/e, pcomb, hh, Dif, cst1,
-- comp, mapE, Decomp, sumTo, CombW, ...), the lists contain
--   * carriers: the module R^1 (M, Md, Vec, mod, val, one), sequences and
--     blocks (Seq, Sq, seq, Blk, Blk1, Blk2, emb, embS), regular, Trunc
--     (carrier, image), Fin, plus ('an element of R[T] is a sequence of
--     elements of R^1; a block of T-degree <= k is k entries');
--   * integer arithmetic of degrees (predZ, predPos, subZ, add, addP, neg,
--     negPos, zeroZ, cdeg, toB) where the text computes m - 1 or d - e;
--   * in StepDecomposition and in TermLists (rings of the tower), the
--     quotient ring and its operation aliases (K, Carrier, Q, S, ring, addQ,
--     mulQ, operation, choose/induction/map, image), and 'by definition of
--     the tower' (tower, D, grD, setD, graded, four), as in sag/zmt-weighted4.
ReesGenerators4.Over.EvZ-X: EvZ Seq predZ
ReesGenerators4.Over.EvZ-emb1: Blk Fin M Md Seq Zero emb embS mod tl val
ReesGenerators4.Over.EvZ-pg: Blk2 M Md Seq Sq Zero emb embS iotaR lin mod one pgen seq tl val
ReesGenerators4.Over.e-pg: Hom M Md Preserves Vec e ev iotaR mod one val
ReesGenerators4.Over.e-rg0: M Md Vec add addN e ev mod neg negPos one predPos predZ subZ val
ReesGenerators4.Over.e-rgS: Hom M Md Preserves Vec add addN addP e ev iotaR mod neg negPos one predPos predZ regular subZ val zeroZ
ReesGenerators4.Over.EvZ-rg: Blk2 Seq Sq seq
ReesGenerators4.Over.EvZ-cF: Blk Blk2 F S Seq Sq Vs cF comb plus regular seq sum
ReesGenerators4.ReesSumJoin.sum-join: Fin jl jlS jr plus sum
DegreeDecomposition4.Over.pad1: Decomp part plus regular sumTo
DegreeDecomposition4.Over.dec-add: Decomp part regular
DegreeDecomposition4.Over.add-w: Decomp FinDegW
DegreeDecomposition4.BaseDecomposition.dec-one: Decomp cdeg dec-pos graded int-dec keep nat-dec part plus pr regular sumTo toB zeroZ
DegreeDecomposition4.StepDecomposition.dec-const: Decomp Hom K S graded inclusion part regular ring
DegreeDecomposition4.StepDecomposition.dec-X: Decomp K S addQ cdeg choose graded induction map mulQ operation part plus pr predPos predZ regular ring toB
DegreeDecomposition4.StepDecomposition.bounded: FinDeg FinDegW K S Seq carrier hor image ring
DegreeDecomposition4.TowerDecomposition.fin-deg: Carrier D FD K Q S grD graded image ring set setD tower
ReesKernel4.Over.cert-of: CSeq Cert Coef S Seq Sq Vs XS cF comb consS pcomb plus seq sum
ReesKernel4.Over.ev-pcomb: CSeq Coef S Seq Sq Vs hh pcomb regular seq
ReesKernel4.Over.certU: Blk Blk1 Cert CertW Fin Hc M Md Seq e elR ev hh mod regular
ReesKernel4.Over.ker-of-elim: InJ JW Ker carrier image
ReesKernel4.Over.ev-deg0: Hom ev iotaR
ReesKernel4.Over.Lower.ev-y': Hom Preserves ev iotaR lw regular sum y'
ReesKernel4.Over.Lower.rel-sum: Seq Sq seq
ReesKernel4.Over.tele: Seq Sq msub seq
ReesKernel4.Over.dif-step: Dif NM Seq Sq XpowB Xs carrier image seq
ReesKernel4.Over.dif-in: Dif NM Seq Sq XpowB carrier image msub seq zeroZ
ReesKernel4.Over.jgen-in: Blk Blk2 Hom NM Preserves Seq Sq carrier comb image iotaR regular seq sum two
ReesKernel4.Over.elim-of-hom: Elim NM Seq Sq carrier cst1 image seq
ReesKernel4.Over.ker-elim-dec: Decomp Elim Ker NM Seq carrier cdeg cst1 image part regular
ReesComponents4.ReesFinComb.AddW.eq: CombW comb k k' plus regular sum term
ReesComponents4.ReesFinBound.fin-bound: Bounded Fin carrier image
ReesComponents4.Over.prX-comb: comb regular sum
ReesComponents4.Over.below:
ReesComponents4.Over.ev-value-map: Expr Hom add addP ev mapE neg negPos regular subZ sum value zeroZ
ReesComponents4.Over.ev-comp: cdeg comp exprOf
ReesComponents4.Over.certX: HX regular
ReesComponents4.Over.comp-elim: InJ JW cdeg
ReesComponents4.Over.value-decomp: AllE Decomp Expr Hom mapE part regular sum value
ReesComponents4.Over.part-comps: Bounded PartW carrier cdeg comp exprOf image regular toB value
ReesComponents4.Over.Generate.gen-in: Decomp FinDeg FinDegW InComb carrier image part regular
ReesComponents4.Over.Generate.generate: Blk Blk1 E InComb InF L blk carrier gl image len mod regular
ReesPresentation4.Concrete.presentation: Blk Blk1 Elim F Gen Md NM ReesW carrier emb embS image
ReesPresentation4.Concrete.ker-elim:
ReesPresentation4.Concrete.WithGens.kernel-generated: elR one ub val
ReesPresentation4.TermLists.hom-mono: B Carrier D Hom Q S four image mono ring size tower
ReesPresentation4.TermLists.hom-phiT: B Carrier D Hom HomDeg Q S TPoly addQ choose four image induction map operation phiT ring tower
